    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***FIRST TIME BUYERS DREAM HOME***\r\n\r\nMurphy Mullan Estate Agents are delighted to bring to market 14 Drumcairn Park, a three-bedroom terrace property located in a quiet cul-de-sac. This property is sure to impress a wide range of buyers, thanks to its sunny rear garden, highly convenient location and the wealth of amenities and services nearby.\r\n\r\nThe internal accommodation is bright and spacious, comprising an entrance hallway, living room, and kitchen/dining room. Upstairs, there are 3 well-proportioned bedrooms and a spacious family bathroom. Outside, the property boasts a substantial rear garden with a westerly aspect and pedestrian rear access. There is a drive-in to the front for off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is truly unbeatable. The Square Shopping Centre and Tallaght Hospital are all in close proximity, while the Fettercairn Luas stop is only a short 5–10 minute walk, offering excellent connectivity. Tallaght IT, along with a wide choice of schools, shops, leisure facilities, pubs and restaurants, are all within easy walking distance. The property also benefits from quick access to major road networks, including the M50, N7 and N81, making commuting effortless.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is a Must!"
      },
